<title>USA: CME Sept S&amp;P 500 futures fall initial 15-pt limit.</title>
<headline>CME Sept S&amp;P 500 futures fall initial 15-pt limit.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CME September Standard &amp; Poor's 500 futures fell the initial 15-point limit in afternoon trade.</p>
<p>Trading will halt for two minutes if the contract is offered limit at the end of 15 minutes or at 1430 CDT/1930 GMT.</p>
<p>The next downside limit is 30 points until 1430 CDT/1930 GMT. ((Derivatives desk 312-408-8750))</p>
<p>E-mail derivatives@reuters.com</p>
</text>
